---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import OptimizedImage from '../../components/OptimizedImage.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Toile Blanche | Saint-Paul de Vence"
  description="Seven houses, grown into one. Assembled over twelve years from neighbouring properties in Saint-Paul de Vence."
  ogImage="https://www.toileblanche.com/assets/images/ambiance/IMG_3081.jpg"
>
  <Nav theme="light" />

  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="abt-hero">
      <div class="abt-hero-inner">
        <p class="abt-hero-eyebrow">Provenance — 2004–2026</p>
        <h1>Seven houses,<br />grown into one.</h1>
        <p class="abt-hero-tagline">Assembled over twelve years from neighbouring properties in Saint-Paul de Vence — each building with its own history, its own light, its own place in the gardens.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- GALLERY: Events-style grid -->
    <section class="abt-gallery">
      <div class="abt-gallery-inner">
        <div class="abt-gallery-grid">
          <div class="abt-gallery-cell">
            <img src="/assets/images/aboutgrid/20240817_Toile Blanche-66.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="Stone terrace and Provençal gardens at Toile Blanche estate" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="abt-gallery-cell">
            <img src="/assets/images/aboutgrid/IMG_5950 (1).jpg" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="Gardens and olive trees at Toile Blanche in Saint-Paul de Vence" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="abt-gallery-cell">
            <img src="/assets/images/aboutgrid/StP25-ToileBlanche-c-GaelleSimon-21.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="Pool area and Mediterranean architecture at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="abt-gallery-cell">
            <img src="/assets/images/aboutgrid/IMG_2069.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="Courtyard and gardens at the Toile Blanche estate" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="abt-gallery-cell">
            <img src="/assets/images/aboutgrid/IMG_3081-800w.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 50vw, 25vw" width="800" height="533" alt="Estate buildings and sculpture in the gardens of Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="abt-gallery-cell">
            <img src="/assets/images/aboutgrid/page-img-3babf958fd968c.avif" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="Terrace overlooking the gardens at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="abt-gallery-cell">
            <img src="/assets/images/aboutgrid/IMG_1902.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="Mediterranean garden and stone architecture at Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="abt-gallery-cell">
            <img src="/assets/images/aboutgrid/6655f11dee7a2b5af77d6497_IMG_2723.avif" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="Gardens and valley view at Toile Blanche, Saint-Paul de Vence" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE BROTHERS + THE STORY -->
    <section class="abt-narrative">
      <div class="abt-narrative-inner">
        <div class="abt-narrative-left">
          <h2>The Brothers</h2>
          <p>Nicolas, Gilles, and Gregory Leroy are the creative force behind Toile Blanche. Hailing from Belgium, the three brothers joined forces in 1997 to form an artistic collective. At Toile Blanche, their vision takes on a new dimension: they welcome resident artists, their works adorn the suites, and their sculptures flourish in the gardens.</p>
          <p class="abt-narrative-quote">Toile Blanche runs a quiet cultural programme throughout the season. Most of it happens without announcement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="abt-narrative-right">
          <h2>The Story</h2>
          <p>One by one, from neighbours who became friends, they converted each building into suites, connected them with gardens, and filled the walls with art. The result is 22 rooms, two restaurants, and something that is genuinely difficult to categorise.</p>
          <p class="abt-narrative-quote">The pool is warm. The rosé is cold. The art will make you stop and think, and then you will go back to the pool. This is the point.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FULL BLEED IMAGE -->
    <section class="abt-full-bleed">
      <div class="abt-full-bleed-wrap">
        <OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/ambiance/StP25-ToileBlanche-c-GaelleSimon-38.jpg" sizes="100vw" width={4899} height={3266} alt="The domain of Toile Blanche in Saint-Paul de Vence" loading="lazy" widths={[800, 1200]} />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE VISION -->
    <section class="abt-vision">
      <div class="abt-vision-inner">
        <h2>A home away from home — for people who have exceptional homes.</h2>
        <p class="abt-vision-label">Strategy — Net-Zero 2030</p>
        <p>In 2026, Toile Blanche was declared a work by the artists. It continues to operate normally, but with the added weight of an archival responsibility. Our goal is net-zero 2030 — ensuring that the Provençal memory persists for another two centuries. We prioritize local ingredients, maintain our gardens without pesticides, and partner with Hotels for Trees to preserve the landscape that shelters this work.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="abt-cta">
      <p class="abt-cta-tagline">Enter the canvas.</p>
      <div class="abt-cta-actions">
        <a href="/map" class="abt-cta-map-link" aria-label="View interactive estate map">
          <img src="/assets/images/estate-map.png" alt="Toile Blanche estate map — view interactive map" class="abt-cta-map-img" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="abt-cta-map-label">View estate map</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/restaurants" class="abt-cta-link">Discover the Tables &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  /* ─── HERO ─── */
  .abt-hero {
    padding: 160px 80px 80px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC;
  }
  .abt-hero-inner {
    max-width: 900px;
  }
  .abt-hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #9C9080;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .abt-hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: #1C1917;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .abt-hero-tagline {
    font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 24px);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #6B6256;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  /* ─── GALLERY: Events-style grid ─── */
  .abt-gallery {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC;
  }
  .abt-gallery-inner {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 64px 80px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .abt-gallery-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
    min-height: 0;
  }
  .abt-gallery-cell {
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 0;
    aspect-ratio: 1/1;
  }
  .abt-gallery-cell img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.8s ease;
  }
  .abt-gallery-cell:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  /* ─── NARRATIVE ─── */
  .abt-narrative {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC;
  }
  .abt-narrative-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 64px 80px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .abt-narrative-left h2,
  .abt-narrative-right h2 {
    font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #1C1917;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .abt-narrative-left > p,
  .abt-narrative-right > p {
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #3D3530;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .abt-narrative-right {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .abt-callout {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 32px;
    background: rgba(226, 217, 204, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(226, 217, 204, 0.3);
  }
  .abt-callout-title {
    font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #1C1917;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .abt-callout p:last-child {
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #6B6256;
  }

  .abt-narrative-quote {
    font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #6B6256;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid #E2D9CC;
  }

  /* ─── FULL BLEED ─── */
  .abt-full-bleed {
    background: #F5F2ED;
  }
  .abt-full-bleed-wrap {
    aspect-ratio: 4899 / 3266;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .abt-full-bleed-wrap picture {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .abt-full-bleed-wrap img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  /* ─── VISION ─── */
  .abt-vision {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC;
  }
  .abt-vision-inner {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 72px 80px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .abt-vision-inner h2 {
    font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #1C1917;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .abt-vision-label {
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #9C9080;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .abt-vision-inner > p:last-child {
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #6B6256;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ─── CTA ─── */
  .abt-cta {
    padding: 64px 80px;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC;
  }
  .abt-cta-tagline {
    font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px);
    color: #3D3530;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .abt-cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .abt-cta-map-link {
    display: block;
    max-width: 900px;
    width: 100%;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .abt-cta-map-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.92;
  }
  .abt-cta-map-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .abt-cta-map-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #9C9080;
    margin-top: 12px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .abt-cta-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #FAF8F3;
    background: #9e5c4a;
    padding: 16px 36px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .abt-cta-btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .abt-cta-link {
    font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #9C9080;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .abt-cta-link:hover {
    color: #3D3530;
  }

  /* ─── RESPONSIVE ─── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .abt-hero {
      padding: 140px 24px 64px;
    }
    .abt-gallery-inner {
      padding: 48px 24px;
    }
    .abt-gallery-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .abt-narrative-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 48px 24px;
      gap: 48px;
    }
    .abt-narrative-right {
      padding-top: 0;
    }
    .abt-vision-inner {
      padding: 64px 24px;
    }
    .abt-cta {
      padding: 48px 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
